== ENV ==
WEATHER:
* October 16, 2026 20:38 moderate rain started.
* 06:00 total overnight rainfall 60ml/254mmø ~1.2mm
* 08:02 overcast and fresh, light East breezes.
* 09:00 very hot with no breezes. Some disperse clouds. Concrete area hot and fan in use.
* 11:30 intense sun and very hot.
NOTES & other env:
* overnight and early-morning a lot of small mosquitoes. no ants and no flies observed. 
* 18:50 many small (they are in fact tiny species) but very painful.

== HUMAN ==
* normal if not logged.
* 07:00 loud music from number 25. lasted ~1 hour.

++++++++ STOOLS ++++++++

== OVERNIGHT stools ==
**Some stools may be individually logged under bird name**
GAMEFOWLS (out):
* normal. 
Young Gamefowls, GameSilkies and Silkies (in):
* selves: no bird slept there 
* window bamboo stand: Alpha Phoenix on the left formed stools, Beta Phoenix on the right wet stools with high certainty trace blood. very high attribution. 
* area -1: Branquinho was the only one here, normal stools. Transit birds produced 
* area 0: transit birds here only 
* area 1: large mucus with pea flowers stool coloration and high certainty trace blood.
a few more smaller mucus and one significant strips of blood.
very few insignificant pale greens stools. 
* area 2: some green stools, not pale green. dome mucus, I could not have certainty on some reddish marks.
* area 3: no birds slept here.

== DAY stools ==
**Some stools may be individually logged**
+30min after coop open:
* one small wet drop only with white material i don't know if urate or mucus.
MORNING:
* 
AFTERNOON:
* 15:12 ts: mucus yellow drop with bubbles and little green faecal component. very fresh drop and Left Wing Red had transit there.

== FEED/WATER ==
BOOST (indiv):
* mix1: own Silkie egg yolk ~95%, rest Yakult and NVV.
WATER:
* Trace Yakult. 
* 11:00 garlic water.
FOOD:
* at coop opening served yesterday cooked rice mix.
* 14:04 served fresh corn with bread mixed with ½ normal dose of NVV. Very high acceptance.
* 15:19 served cooked rice with ginger, garlic, chicken skeleton and 2mm pellets. low to moderate acceptance. 

== BEHAVIOUR ==
AGGRESSION / TONE:
** this is a high aggression flock environment **
* ~05:50 on dim light accessing Arriba, Black and mother, Pequenina attacked me on head (no bleeding). Isolated immediately outside.
* 08:21 Alpha Phoenix crowing and attacking Ventura with physical contact.
* 08:23 drama noise. Upon investigation a few birds were moving away from Branquinho with bad intentions looking. Ventura looks injured on the right side. i could not get him to access, than he started crowing like a territorial roosters to impose others he has done authorities. minutes later he and Branquinho kept on crowing one after the other. Looks territorial behaviour. 
* 09:11 Branquinho attacked Alpha removing dome feathers from him.
* 09:24 Branquinho attacking Alpha Phoenix,  no contact.
* 10:28 Branquinho attacked Venture with contact force causing Ventura to escape by jumping while Branquinho remained constantly falling. I isolated Branquinho very stressed and screaming. 
* 14:26 Branquinho attacked Red October but the mother defended very well. I isolated him fir the second time today falling over, can't walk or stand properly. I left the door open where I kept the chicks but they all come out and I did not notice while I was cleaning concrete area to soon feed the birds.
* 16:24 ibreleaaed Pequenina to go sleep, she went to fight Pipi, isolated again in under 2 minutes of freedom.
* 17:11 Pequenina isolated after 2 minutes released to go sleep. Attacked Gamy twice, first time with contact. Gamy is not walking normal, I need to check him tomorrow. As per Ventura he is walking fine. Most birds are already ready to sleep.

