# young Gamecocks
# Bico Preto
* weighing discontinued temporarily: neck function and behaviour. Neck injury.
* October 16, 2026 22:15 drank a lot of water on his own, over 20 times.
* 05:25 20 items, 3ml water
* 07:21 65 items, 3ml water, drank on his own, wet feed.
* 07:38 after finishing therapy with him and placing him on the soil, Tchétché come pecked him on the neck and removed one feather. I can make only little improvement on his leg that won't make progress overall. 
* 11:28 60 items, 4ml water, drank substantially on his own. Very long positive session with him.
< 11:13 ts: Strange but not strange, it's biology.
Bico Preto set on my lap with is left body firm on my belly, my left hand holding him firmly. That caused him to constantly shake head/neck, constantly beak-beak or beak open and kelpt on shaking. Tilted neck left placing head between my arm and body. I managed to Strait his neck with a lot of shaking.  Than shaking reduced substantially  and stops time to time.this position goes against his normal posture and triggered all that reaction. Analyse and write a log entry. He still on my lap while I interact here with chatgpt.
* 13:28 30 items, 2ml water, drank some.  not well, keeps closing eyes, i could not force more feed.
* 15:55 65 items, 7ml water, drank on his own. Left eye is blurred,  I can only see left eye, o been checking other eye he keeps open when closes left. I gave 1 drop Eye Comfort.  he does not look well. Since around middle May or early in isolation. with full care from me.
* 17:26 10 items 3ml water, drank sime water. His left eye improved.  I've noticed fog eyes for a few days and he can't pick rice. Left eye is short distance. 
* 18:59 50 items, 4ml water, drank well on his own.
* 
**TOTAL 240 items (should gave been a bit more but hard to feed him lately) | 24ml water**

---
# Branquinho (systematic neurologic - weight discontinued)
* ~05:45 1 dose BIO+B12
* i did not check his crop because of stress.
* 19:31 he fall off from area -1 top on movable coop. Then there was panic birds getting  away from him trying without success to jump to other movable coops. The light is very dim he cannot see but buses touching and memory. I need time to be able to do something on his neck. His neck has deeper injury than Bico Preto before. The reason Bico Preto is worse now is related to a cascade of 8 or 9 issues that I've logged about.

