++++++++ GENERAL ++++++++
== FLOCK/CARETAKER/OBS ==
NOTES:
* 19:29 lt: yesterday in afternoon my landlady and ex partner offered me dome money to buy food fir the chickens with the money she received from the government regarding the 2 weeks flood I had here. It's my money any way but I refused and I asked again who is judicially responsible for not cleaning the drainer that many times I pointed out.
* 19:33 some birds panting. Gamma Phoenix is panting  too. Beta and Alpha stopped panting. Roosters don't pant or pant only occasionally on certain conditions. The GameSilkies are different, my past logs shows this, they pant more than both other breeds. I wonder if they got a bad gene??
today Bico Preto sleeps after area 3 and area 3 is empty so when i need to access him i move his coop to that area.

